=== Other Changes ===
* Slightly improved navigation in the collection menu. (faster and loops back on itself when scrolling vertically)
* Updated game over sprites for some of the items from Booster #4.
* {{i|Shade}}'s behavior got minor changes.
* {{i|Haemolacria}} now uses the same tear delay calculation as {{i|Ipecac}}.
* {{i|Lil Monstro}}'s shooting sound effect was replaced with a more appropriate one.
* [[Stoney|Stonies]] now have a brief death animation and break into rock debris.
* Slightly toned down the tear delay penalty from {{i|Haemolacria}} + {{i|Monstro's Lung}} + {{i|Brimstone}}/{{i|Dr. Fetus}}
* {{i|Betrayal}} will no longer trigger if there are less than 2 enemies in the room.
* [[Spikes]] will now start (and remain) in their lowered position when entering a cleared [[Pressure Plate]] room.
* [[Charm]]ed enemies will now prioritize non charmed enemies unless there aren't any.
* [[Nerve Ending 2]] now plays a sound when attacking.
* [[Nerve Ending 2]] can never replace [[Nerve Ending]]s next to doors.
* [[Swinger]]s now spawn with their head retracted and extend over 2 seconds. (so the head is less likely to spawn right on top of the player with no warning)
* Decreased the damage rate of Level 3 and 4 [[Bandage Girl]] to match [[Meat Boy]] (it was way too high before)
* Increased the damage rate of {{i|Angry Fly}} to match other fly orbitals.
* [[Stoney|Stonies]] now roar less often and will stop doing it while catching their breath.
* Halved the damage of {{i|Shoop da Whoop!}} to compensate for the fix applied to it. (total damage remains the same, but it will be inflicted over a slightly longer period of time)
* [[Pickup]]s can now be picked up as soon as they hit the ground.
* [[Eternal Heart]]s will now take half a heart worth of damage from any lethal hit taken with only [[Soul Heart]]s.
* Permanently [[charm]]ed enemies will no longer try to go after {{i|Punching Bag}}.
* {{i|Number One}} and {{i|Kidney Stone}} now cause Isaac to fire "tears" from the middle instead of from his eyes, and at a slightly lower height.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} now rewinds event counters as well. (this includes [[Donation Machine|Donation]]s and {{i|Eden's Blessing}}s)
* Using [[? Card]] with {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} will now consume the card.
* Removed the 5 uses limit from {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} as all (or most) known game breaking exploits have been fixed.
* {{i|Lost Contact}} now only affects the player's tears. (and tears shot by {{i|Incubus}})
* Reduced base HP of [[Blue Gaper]]s and added stage HP so they have slightly more reasonable health when encountered early.
* [[Reward Plate]]s that spawn enemies will now close the doors as well.
* {{i|Breath of Life}} will now immediately give invincibility frames when triggered by {{i|Void}}. (previous behavior made it extremely exploitable)
* Added some visual feedback when {{i|Breath of Life}} provides its invincibility.
* {{i|Breath of Life}} can now be held down between rooms.
* Spectral tears will no longer bounce off rocks with {{i|Rubber Cement}}.
* Added a visual cue to {{t|Hairpin}} when it recharges the player's active item upon entering a boss room, audio cue now plays after boss intro instead of before.
* {{i|BFFS!}} now increases spawner familiar spawn rates.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} will now also revert the player's [[character]] if it was changed by an item during the current room.
* [[Donation Machine|Donation]] will now gradually accelerate if the player stays in contact with the donation machine. (applies to [[Greed Machine|Greed donations]] as well)
* [[Achievement]] popups can now be fast forwarded by tapping Start.
* Updated charge bars to be less visually intrusive.
* Added extra sounds and effects to [[creep]] attacks. (from [[Conjoined Fatty|Conjoined Fatties]] and [[Meatball]]s)
* Following [[familiar]]s are no longer pushed back when very close to the player. (behavior more consistent with Rebirth)
* [[Co-op]] babies are now saved and restored by {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}.
* Added unique sounds for [[Gold Heart]]s, [[Black Heart]]s and [[Golden Bomb]]s.
* Added better visual feedback for [[Gold Heart]]s when breaking.
* [[Gold Heart]]s will now turn nearby enemies to gold when breaking.
* [[Eden]] can now be randomed if the player has Eden tokens.
* Reward Plates will now lock the room when spawning enemies.
* Afterbirth floor exclusive enemies (i.e. burning/flooded/dank) will no longer appear in Rebirth floors.
* [[Homunculus]] and [[Begotten]] will now be chained to an adjacent rock if the nearest wall is more than 1 grid cell away.
* The [[Forsaken]] will now move to a more appropriate place to perform his Brimstone attack in L shaped rooms.
* Multiple [[Forsaken]]s in the same room will now be able to spawn their own bony each and will always spin their Brimstone attack in the same direction at the same speed.
* Most sources of [[Blue Spider]]s will now throw those spiders out instead of spawning them on the ground.
* [[Red Chest]]s inside a [[Devil Room]] will no longer teleport the player to the Devil Room.
* {{i|Moving Box}} is now unlocked by using {{i|Pandora's Box}} in the [[Dark Room]]. (as it seems to have been originally intended)
* [[Co-op]] babies can no longer drop out while the player is playing a pickup animation. (could be used to exploit devil deals)
* [[Poop]]s spawned by {{i|E. Coli}} and {{i|Flush!}} now react to damage similarly to regular poops.
* Movable [[TNT|TNT barrels]] now take damage exactly like their regular counterparts. (they will take less shots to destroy at base damage)
* {{i|Mine Crafter}} will now spawn a [[TNT|TNT barrel]] directly at the player's position rather than on a nearby free tile.
* All variants of [[Stone Grimace]]s now explode into rock debris when killed with [[Chaos Card]] or {{i|Little Horn}} and will no longer respawn when reentering the room if killed.
* {{i|Head of Krampus}} no longer has a chance to rotate.
* Achievements related to sleeping in [[bed]]s ({{t|Wooden Cross}}, {{i|Blanket}}) will now be unlocked after the sleeping animation rather than before.
* Bombs spawned from {{i|Scatter Bombs}} will now actually scatter around.
* Small bombs from {{i|Scatter Bombs}} now leave smaller craters.

=== Bug Fixes ===
* Fixed [[Mr. Fred]] not creating a blood explosion on death.
* Fixed some minor graphical issues in the main menu.
* Fixed special rocks (ie pots and mushrooms) not playing the appropriate sound in some floors.
* Fixed boil rocks giving the wrong drops when destroyed in the [[Blue Womb]].
* Fixed [[The Haunt]]'s champion variants and [[Delirium]]'s Haunt form not being transparent during their first phase.
* [[Delirium]]'s [[Brownie]] form no longer transitions into the second phase (turning into a weakened [[Dangle]]) when at low health.
** This also applies to Delirium's black Brownie form (this prevents Delirium from dying earlier than intended without properly playing its death animation, since black Brownie spawns two [[Dank Squirt]]s upon death).
* Fixed [[Delirium]] turning into a [[Lil' Haunt]].
* Fixed multidimensional tears not scaling properly. (only one of the two layers would scale)
* Fixed [[The Magician]] and [[Judgement]] having unwanted transparent pixels.
* Fixed {{i|Lil Monstro}} not playing its shooting animation.
* Laser familiars like {{i|Robo-Baby}} and {{i|Lil Brimstone}} can now damage [[fireplace]]s and [[poop]]s.
* Fixed [[Stone Grimace]]s not closing their eyes when the room is cleared.
* Fixed a broken interaction between {{i|Lachryphagy}} and {{i|Death's Touch}}.
* Fixed an infinite recursion issue with {{i|Haemolacria}} + {{i|Lead Pencil}} and {{i|Haemolacria}} + {{i|Dr. Fetus}} + {{i|Sad Bombs}}.
* Fixed [[The Cage]]'s grey creep not blinking like damaging creep normally does.
* Fixed [[The Cage]]'s rolling attack ending as soon as it begins.
* Fixed Level 4 {{i|Bumbo}} occasionally getting stuck trying to pick up a [[coin]].
* Fixed [[Mushroom (Enemy)|Mushroom]]s not displaying [[status effect]]s, not playing their hiding animation, and moving around way too much when shot.
* Added a generic firing animation to {{i|Brimstone}} for combos that keep its appearance but removes its ability to charge (i.e. {{i|Haemolacria}}).
* [[Troll Bomb]]s now play their drop sound when they hit the ground, not when they spawn.
* Fixed [[Charm]]ed enemies not being able to deal contact damage to a charmed target.
* Fixed [[Pressure Plate]] rooms granting a charge when bombing out of them.
* Fixed [[Spikes]] rarely staying in their raised position when clearing [[Pressure Plate]] rooms.
* Fixed boss HP bar counting negative boss HP, causing it to report inaccurate values or even disappear when bosses are killed with very high damage.
* Fixed {{i|Razor Blade}} always giving blood tears when held instead of only when activated.
* Fixed mushroom items not playing their unique pickup sound.
* Fixed {{i|Euthanasia}} being able to kill [[Ultra Greed]] during his transformation into [[Ultra Greedier]].
* Fixed the [[Greed]] fight before [[Ultra Greed]] not triggering the victory jingle when cleared.
* Fixed [[Mega Clotty|Mega Clotties]] not making any sound when stomping.
* Fixed a glitch which caused {{i|Shoop da Whoop!}} to only deal damage during its first few frames, and gave it a flickering impact effect.
* [[Death's Head]]s no longer deal contact damage during their death animation.
* Fixed bosses spawned by {{i|Delirious}} dropping key pieces when killed in angel rooms.
* Fixed {{i|Succubus}} not granting its damage bonus when obtained via {{i|Cambion Conception}}.
* Fixed [[Devil deal]]s costing [[Soul Heart]]s instead of [[Red Heart]]s if all of the player’s heart containers are empty.
* Fixed orbitals jittering when spawning or entering a new room.
* Fixed the {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} not discharging on use when overcharged.
* Fixed an exploit involving the {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} and the {{i|Schoolbag}}.
* Fixed permanently [[charm]]ed enemies not being able to shoot projectiles through each other.
* Fixed use animation not playing when activating {{i|Satanic Bible}}.
* Fixed {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} duplicating expendable familiars (blue flies/spiders) and perma-[[charm]]ed enemies.
* Fixed projectiles from perma-[[charm]]ed enemies being blocked by familiars.
* [[Dressing Table]] will no longer spawn locked items or items that were previously picked up.
* Fixed [[Dressing Table]] visually duplicating itself when dropping a collectible after being bombed.
* Fixed [[Rag Man]]'s appear animation lasting much longer than intended.
* Fixed [[The Fallen]]'s brimstone attack being delayed due to previous changes to [[Krampus]]' AI.
* Fixed [[Krampus]]' brimstone attack animation not matching the timing of the actual attack.
* Fixed [[Famine]] starting his dash later than he's supposed to, resulting in a weird looking animation.
* Fixed blue [[Famine]]'s head playing its attack animation with the wrong timing.
* Fixed surprise minibosses such as [[Greed]] and [[angel]]s not playing the alternate boss music when they should.
** This also applies to [[The Fallen]] that appears before [[Satan]].
* Fixed [[The Hollow]] occasionally getting stuck along a wall.
* Fixed [[The Hollow]]'s champion variants often not dropping what they're supposed to drop.
* Fixed [[Fred]]s looking jittery when jumping over obstacles.
* Some [[transformation]]s will now properly override the player's skin color ([[Leviathan]], [[Bob]] and [[Fun Guy]])
* Fixed {{i|Hive Mind}} head costume not showing up in game
* Fixed an issue where rebuilding the player's costume map would cause visual issues with costumes containing multiple head layers with different spritesheets (such as {{i|Mysterious Liquid}})
* [[Rune]]s and [[Dice Shard]] no longer play a paper sound on pickup.
* Fixed [[Backasswards]] having a chance to give items that weren't unlocked yet or multiple copies of the same item, and allowing starting items to appear again during the run.
* Fixed [[Mulligan]]s and all variants instantly exploding if killed during their spawn animation.
* Fixed [[Cod Worm]]s being briefly vulnerable during their spawn animation.
* Fixed [[Knight]]s and [[Eye]]s being completely invincible during their spawn animation. (Knights will still block tears from the front and sides)
* Fixed [[Blastocyst]] not splitting when killed while poisoned. (and awkwardly sliding towards the player during its splitting animation sometimes)
* Added a small random delay before [[Gusher]]s, [[Splasher]]s and [[Blubber]]s can shoot projectiles (so they don't immediately shoot as soon as an enemy turns into them)
* Fixed [[Dople]]s firing their first shot from the middle of the room when the player enters the room while firing.
* Fixed [[The Lamb]]'s body not triggering the boss victory jingle if killed last.
* Fixed [[Suture]] not making a small grunt when it detaches after Contusion is killed.
* {{i|Mom's Knife}} now applies status effects in a more consistent way.
* Fixed [[Big Horn]] getting instantly killed by {{i|Sharp Straw}} (among with other minor animation fixes)
* Added interpolation to enemy projectiles with wiggling effects (they will now look much smoother in motion)
* Fixed [[Slot Machine|slot machines]] appearing as [[battery|batteries]] in the minimap if a battery is present in the same room.
* Fixed [[Rag Mega]]'s invincibility ending later than what his animation would suggest.
* Fixed [[Mimic Chest]]s instantly opening and damaging the player if they spawn at their position when clearing a room.
* Fixed [[Greed Machine]]s jamming even when the HUD displays a jamming rate of 0%.
* [[Blue Gaper]]s and [[Greed Gaper]]s will now have a proper appear animation if spawned by a room rather than by a boss.
* Fixed [[Portal]]s being able to spawn two enemies in very quick succession upon entering a room.
* Fixed some champion types rarely spawning what they're supposed to spawn in hard mode. (such as splitting champions)
* Fixed enemies spawned from splitting champions sometimes appearing too far away from the original enemy.
* Exploding champions will no longer explode if killed very close to the player 1 second within entering the room.
* Unlockable pickups (i.e. [[Golden Bomb]]s) will be replaced with a random variant if they haven't been unlocked yet.
* Made [[Rage Creep]]'s attack animation slightly longer so it won't start moving until its laser has fully disappeared.
* Fixed {{i|Technology 2}} beam being deleted and respawned twice if maintained during a room transition.
* Fixed not being able to pick up a [[trinket]] if the player has that trinket's effect via the {{t|Error}} trinket.
* Fixed {{i|Death's List}} streak ending if a perma-[[charm]]ed enemy dies.
* Fixed spawner familiars (i.e. [[sack]]s) not playing their floating animation until they spawn something.
* Fixed {{i|Little C.H.A.D.}} having missing animation frames.
* Fixed {{i|Little C.H.A.D.}} playing its kissing sound every room cleared instead of only when it spawns hearts.
* Spawner familiars now have a more consistent spawning algorithm.
* Fixed the {{t|The Left Hand}} not affecting [[Bomb Chest]]s.
* Fixed {{i|Lil Gurdy}} being excessively loud when hitting walls.
* Fixed some minor visual issues when turning back time with {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}. (such as fires being invisible during the teleport in animation)
* [[Champion]] enemies will no longer deal contact damage if the non-champion version doesn't.
* [[Charm]]ed [[Portal]]s will now spawn permanently charmed enemies.
* Fixed {{i|Spear Of Destiny}} hit detection being shifted up by several pixels.
* Fixed the [[Bestiary]] not counting kills for [[Ultra Greed]] and [[Ultra Greedier]]
* Fixed {{i|Glaucoma}} blood tears being completely invisible.
* Fixed {{i|Multidimensional Baby}} not working properly with Anti Gravity tears.
* Fixed miniboss rooms not displaying the right [[character]] name if the player's character was changed via an item.
* Fixed [[pickup]]s not showing up in the [[Shop]] in the minimap.
* Fixed [[red creep]] not being darkened in {{s|Womb}} when playing [[Greed Mode]].
* Fixed [[Eve]] not starting with the {{i|Razor Blade}} if the item itself hasn't been unlocked yet.
* {{i|Holy Mantle}} will no longer be restored if the player saves and continues after losing it.
* Fixed [[Famine]]’s charge and [[Ultra Greed]]’s dash being able to instantly kill the player in some cases.
* [[Boss]] [[heart]] drops now depend on the room seed. (they no longer depend on the order in which the bosses are killed)
* Fixed [[Daily Challenges|daily]] related [[achievement]]s incorrectly notifying that all challenges have been unlocked.
* Fixed a memory leak occurring when exiting a run while a [[Co-op]] baby is still on screen.
* Fixed up some code related to [[Co-op]] babies to make them work better with {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}
* Fixed [[Lil Haunt]]s having an incorrect sprite on the death screen (and in the [[bestiary]])
* Fixed a bug which caused certain [[Greed mode]] waves to be much more common than others.
* Fixed missing animation warning spam caused by [[Stoney|Stonies]].
* Fixed blue and purple [[fireplace]]s having a chance to drop multiple [[Soul Heart]]s if extinguished by multiple simultaneous explosions.
* Fixed {{i|Incubus}}' charge bar being incorrect with {{i|Mom's Knife}}.
* Fixed some special [[Co-op]] babies giving the wrong amount of hearts back to the player when removed.
* Fixed items that lock the player's aim completely overriding the blink animation
* Fixed a softlock with [[Mega Satan]] caused by {{i|Mine Crafter}}
* Fixed [[sack]]s dropping [[Battery|batteries]] and [[tarot card]]s way more often than intended.
* Boosted announcer lines for the new [[card]]s and [[pill]]s so they are consistent with the rest.
* {{i|Parasitoid}} will no longer spawn spiders/flies when hitting invincible enemies such as stone grimaces.
* Fixed using {{i|Mr. ME!}} with {{i|Car Battery}} causing stolen items to become non-solid.
* Fixed {{i|Marked}} crosshair not blinking.
* Fixed the inner part of the boss health bar casting a visible extra shadow.
* Fixed some more enemies not having overlay effect attachment points.
* Fixed the character selection wheel decelerating too early when randoming, cycling through characters at minimum speed until reaching the desired character
* Added a failsafe to prevent crashes when too many entity queries are done in a single frame (this fixes a few crashes that occur when a lot of entities are on screen)
* [[Lil Haunt]]s are no longer considered bosses (meaning they can be caught with {{i|Friendly Ball}}) and now have a unique death portrait.
* Fixed a bunch of [[bestiary]] entries using the wrong portrait.
* [[Locust]]s will now only spawn when a room has been entered for the first time. (prevents farming them using {{t|Door Stop}})
* Fixed {{i|Samson's Chains}}' links not being positioned properly with {{i|BFFS!}}.
* Fixed {{i|Gemini}} familiar chain not being properly interpolated.
* Fixed {{i|Gemini}} familiar not scaling with {{i|BFFS!}}.
* Fixed {{t|Pay to Win}} overriding {{i|More Options}}.
* [[Co-op]] babies can no longer borrow {{i|Guillotine}} from the player. (very buggy interaction)
* Fixed rock waves from {{i|Wait What?}} and {{i|Mega Bean}} being able to hurt {{i|Isaac's Heart}} and co-op babies
* Fixed some pills not playing the correct sad/happy animation.
* Fixed being able to clip through item pedestals by running into them.
* {{i|Incubus}} will no longer play sounds when firing {{i|Tech X}}. (was particularly annoying with Brimstone)
* Fixed [[Scarred Para-Bite]]s sometimes spawning a projectile at the player's position when killed during their appear animation.
* Fixed achievement popups being unnecessarily delayed once the player has played 31 or more dailies.
* Fixed {{i|Adrenaline}} not updating when taking certain health affecting pills (such as [[Hematemesis]])
* Fixed {{i|Dark Prince's Crown}} only reapplying its buff 1 frame after entering a new room, triggering Found HUD each time.
* Bombs swallowed by [[Chub]] will now do their proper explosion effects.
* Fixed {{i|Flush!}} and {{i|Brimstone}}+{{i|The Ludovico Technique}} affecting friendly enemies.
* Added safeguards to prevent boss champions that double themselves (i.e. red [[Monstro]], pink [[The Cage]] and blue [[Gurdy Jr.]]) from spawning on top of the player upon entering the room.
* Fixed {{i|Guillotine}} not firing from the right position with {{t|Duct Tape}}.
* Fixed some {{s|Caves}}/{{s|Depths}} rooms containing [[Wall Creep]]s being slightly broken since Booster #4.
* Fixed a corner wall entity not being generated in one of the L room shapes. (shape 12, causes some issues, notably with [[A Card Against Humanity]])
* Fixed being able to fire infinite rockets when using {{i|Doctor's Remote}} with {{i|Marked}}.
* Fixed [[sack]]s dropped from {{i|Sack of Sacks}} often containing identical [[card]]s.
* Fixed being able to teleport into an Error room on top of a hazard. (i.e. a [[Spiked Chest]]s)
* {{i|Parasitoid}} tears now spawn blue flies/spiders at their position rather than the player's. (spawned flies and spiders will be thrown towards the player before targeting enemies)
* Fixed {{i|Athame}} and {{i|Maw Of The Void}} being able to spawn many [[Black Heart]]s when damaging enemies with damage resistance. (i.e. [[Mushroom (Enemy)|Mushrooms]])
* Fixed some on-kill effects (such as {{i|Gimpy}} and {{i|Infestation 2}}) triggering more than once when an enemy is killed by simultaneous damage sources.
* Fixed [[Envy]]'s split parts sharing the same drop seed.
* {{i|Mine Crafter}} will now spawn two [[TNT|TNT barrels]] with {{i|Car Battery}} instead of spawning one and then immediately detonating it.
* [[Chaos Card]] and {{i|Little Horn}} will now properly kill [[fireplace]]s without a blood effect.
* Fixed being able to force a revival with {{i|Guppy's Collar}} or {{t|Broken Ankh}} by saving and resuming the run after dying.
* Fixed portals from {{i|Ventricle Razor}} sometimes not appearing when created in a large room which is then reentered from a different door.
* Fixed not being able to enter {{i|Ventricle Razor}} portals within the same room if the player is in an off screen room. (i.e. [[Devil Room]])
* Fixed [[Devil Room]] doors not having proper door animations and disappearing when closed.
* Fixed {{i|Mom's Wig}} spawning [[Blue Spider]]s way too frequently when the player has a charged attack.
* Fixed {{i|Kidney Stone}} not updating the player's firerate on the final tick of the tear burst. (effectively leaving the player with -1 tear delay until the tear state is updated)
* Fixed being able to keep the firerate buff from {{i|Kidney Stone}} permanently by picking up an item that changes Isaac's attack type during the tear burst.
* Fixed {{i|Eden's Soul}} copying the charge of the previously held active item instead of starting at 0 charge.
* Credits and epilogue will now adapt to the game's volume settings instead of always playing at max volume.
* Familiars will now be teleported to the player's new position if it was changed by a boss such as [[Gurdy]] or [[Mom's Heart]].
* Fixed shadow layer not being loaded correctly in any room that doesn't have the standard 1x1 shape.
* FX layers with parallax will now smoothly transition to their new position upon teleporting across the room.
* Fixed {{i|A Lump of Coal}} and {{i|The Ludovico Technique}} tears looking odd due to always using the biggest tear sprite.

== Mod Support ==
* Fixed alt skin color spritesheets not loading for mod items.
* Fixed a crash when disabling a mod that contains custom characters.
* Character selection ring now has a perspective effect which scales with the number of characters so it never looks cluttered.
* Custom characters will now be placed before Random rather than after.
* Added a custom implementation for the Lua print() function which outputs to the debug console.
* Fixed Player:GetName() causing crashes with [[co-op]] babies.
* Added MC_PRE_ROOM_ENTITY_SPAWN Lua callback for entities spawned as part of a room's layout (int type, int variant, int subtype, int gridindex, int seed) -> int type, int variant, int subtype.
* Fixed some mod callbacks crashing if anything other than a table is returned.

== Debug Console Changes ==
* Fixed spawn command ignoring subtype when spawning entities by name. (i.e. heart pickups)
* Console now slides in and out faster and more smoothly, accepts input even while sliding in, and can be closed with Esc.
* Added support for non QWERTY keyboard layouts.
* Backspace can now be held to delete characters quickly.
* Text cursor can now be moved left and right in the console.
* Home and End will now move the cursor to the beginning/end of the current command.
* Ctrl+Home and Ctrl+End will scroll to the beginning and end of the history.
* Numpad Enter can now be used to run commands.
* Added "clear" command to clear the history.
* Clamped console history to 1024 entries to limit memory usage.
* Clamped command buffer to 64 entries to limit memory usage.
* Commands rerun from the command buffer will now be moved rather than copied to the front. (so running the same command multiple times doesn't clutter the command buffer)
* Condensed errors printed by the "lua" command so there is less useless junk at the beginning of the error string.
* Lua errors will now be printed to the console.
* Added automatic text wrapping to both the console history and input.
* Added ConsoleFont parameter to options.ini, set to 1 to use a smaller font. (0 by default, can also be switched in game using Ctrl-Numpad+ and Ctrl-Numpad-)
* Added FadedConsoleDisplay toggle to options.ini, shows recent console on screen even if the console is closed. (disabled by default)
* Added SaveCommandHistory toggle to options.ini, enables or disables saving the console command history between sessions. (enabled by default)
* Debug 4 (high damage) will now actually increase the player's damage stat so it applies to all attack types.
* Debug 5 now shows information about the current room. (notably the room ID)
* Fixed luamod reporting a success if Lua errors were encountered while loading a mod.

