=== Other Changes ===
* Completing [[Greedier Mode]] unlocks achievements from the [[Greed Mode]] too.
* Added 41 new [[co-op]] babies.
* Monster replacements will now only occur with enemies spawned as part of the room layout.
** As a result of this, [[Mushroom (Enemy)|Mushrooms]] no longer spawn after destroying [[Skull]]s.
** [[Greed]] will no longer spawn [[Ministro]]s because of this.
** [[Super Greed]], [[Ultra Greed]] and [[Mom#Champion Variants|Blue Champion Mom]] no longer summon [[Blister (Enemy)|Blisters]].
** [[Meatball]]s no longer spawn [[Mushroom (Enemy)|Mushrooms]] upon death.
** [[Nest]]s will no longer spawn [[Ministro]]s upon death.
** [[Chub]] and [[The Stain]] will no longer spawn [[Maggot#Drowned Charger|Drowned Chargers]]. (This used to happen if they were fought in the [[Flooded Caves]])
** [[Polycephalus#Champion Versions|Red Champion Polycephalus]] will no longer spawn [[Scarred Para-Bite]]s. (This used to happen if it was fought in the [[Scarred Womb]])
** [[Globin]]s spawned by [[Mom]] no longer become [[Dank Globin]]s (This used to happen if she was fought in the [[Dank Depths]]).

